	- the source has no tempo; the tempo here is a guess.
	- the first note of the second ending is placed in the octave of the tie from the last bar
	of the A section (as literally written, the source would put it an octave higher).
	- the tie at the end of the first ending back to the start of the repeat is written with
	laissezVibrer.
